flowchart TD
    A[Review request + file name] --> C[Coordinator Agent]
    C --> R[Reader Agent]
    R --> FT[File Reader Tool]
    FT -->|masked source code| C
    C -->|handoff: source code| V[Reviewer Agent]
    V --> LT[Linter Tool]
    LT -->|lint findings| V
    V -->|structured review JSON| C
    C --> O[Final review response]

    FT -. actual tool trace .-> RG[Ragas Agent / Tool Evaluation]
    LT -. actual tool trace .-> RG
    O -. task outcome + trajectory .-> DE[DeepEval TaskCompletionMetric]
    RG --> Q[Release Quality Gate]
    DE --> Q

    A --> SEC[RBAC / Masking / Audit / Red-team]
    SEC --> Q
    O --> REP[SHA-256 Reproducibility Manifest]
    REP --> Q
    Q --> REL[GO / NO-GO Recommendation]
    CAN[Canary SLA + Rollback] --> REL
    DR[Drift Detection + Incident Note] --> REL
    COMP[GDPR / SOC 2 / Data Residency Checklist] --> REL
